000100*================================================================
000200* PAYROLL - MONTHLY STAFF PAYROLL, SAVINGS BANK BACK OFFICE
000300*
000400* !!! INTENTIONALLY VULNERABLE - DO NOT USE IN PRODUCTION !!!
000500* Demo material for Watchtower, the Alcazar static analyzer.
000600* Every flaw in this program is deliberate; the fixed version is
000700* examples/hardened/PAYROLL.cob.
000800*
000900* Planted flaws: division and money arithmetic without ON SIZE
001000* ERROR, truncating MOVEs, fractions of a cent dropped (no
001100* ROUNDED), binary floating point for the year-to-date tax, an
001200* IBAN on SYSOUT and a shell command to print the checks.
001300*================================================================
001400 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001500 PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
001600 AUTHOR. ALCAZAR DEMO.
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001900 FILE-CONTROL.
002000     SELECT EMP-MASTER ASSIGN TO "EMPMAST.DAT"
002100         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002200         FILE STATUS IS WS-EMP-FS.
002300     SELECT PAY-CHECKS ASSIGN TO "PAYCHK.DAT"
002400         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
002500         FILE STATUS IS WS-CHK-FS.
002600 DATA DIVISION.
002700 FILE SECTION.
002800 FD  EMP-MASTER.
002900     COPY EMPREC.
003000 FD  PAY-CHECKS.
003100 01  CHECK-LINE.
003200     05  CHK-EMP-ID              PIC X(8).
003300     05  FILLER                  PIC X.
003400     05  CHK-NAME                PIC X(20).
003500     05  FILLER                  PIC X.
003600     05  CHK-AMOUNT              PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99.
003700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003800 01  WS-EMP-FS                   PIC XX.
003900     88  EMP-OK                  VALUE "00".
004000     88  EMP-EOF                 VALUE "10".
004100 01  WS-CHK-FS                   PIC XX.
004200 01  WS-PAY-PERIODS              PIC 99 VALUE 12.
004300 01  WS-PERIOD-PAY               PIC 9(7)V99.
004400 01  WS-GROSS-PAY                PIC 9(7)V99.
004500 01  WS-TAX-RATE                 PIC V9999 VALUE .2150.
004600 01  WS-TAX-AMT                  PIC 9(7)V99.
004700 01  WS-NET-PAY                  PIC 9(7)V99.
004800 01  WS-TOTAL-GROSS              PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
004900 01  WS-YTD-TAX                  USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
005000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005100 0000-MAIN.
005200     OPEN INPUT EMP-MASTER
005300     IF NOT EMP-OK
005400         DISPLAY "EMP-MASTER OPEN FAILED, STATUS " WS-EMP-FS
005500         STOP RUN
005600     END-IF
005700     OPEN OUTPUT PAY-CHECKS
005800     PERFORM 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE
005900     PERFORM 2000-PAY-EMPLOYEE UNTIL EMP-EOF
006000     CLOSE EMP-MASTER PAY-CHECKS
006100     DISPLAY "TOTAL GROSS PAID " WS-TOTAL-GROSS
006200     CALL "SYSTEM" USING "lp -d PAYCHECKS PAYCHK.DAT"
006300     STOP RUN.
006400
006500 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE.
006600     READ EMP-MASTER
006700         AT END SET EMP-EOF TO TRUE
006800     END-READ.
006900
007000 2000-PAY-EMPLOYEE.
007100*    WS-PAY-PERIODS comes from the run parameters: zero abends.
007200     DIVIDE EMP-ANNUAL-SALARY BY WS-PAY-PERIODS
007300         GIVING WS-PERIOD-PAY
007400     ADD EMP-BONUS TO WS-PERIOD-PAY GIVING WS-GROSS-PAY
007500     COMPUTE WS-TAX-AMT = WS-GROSS-PAY * WS-TAX-RATE
007600     SUBTRACT WS-TAX-AMT FROM WS-GROSS-PAY GIVING WS-NET-PAY
007700     ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-GROSS
007800     COMPUTE WS-YTD-TAX = WS-YTD-TAX + WS-TAX-AMT
007900     DISPLAY "PAYING " EMP-ID " TO ACCOUNT " EMP-IBAN
008000     MOVE EMP-ID TO CHK-EMP-ID
008100     MOVE EMP-FULL-NAME TO CHK-NAME
008200     MOVE WS-NET-PAY TO CHK-AMOUNT
008300     WRITE CHECK-LINE
008400     PERFORM 1000-READ-EMPLOYEE.
